{"login": "resistor", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "abe6788a536d04f6912fb6732dee7d40849f1840", "message": "Use .sl instead of .rsl for shaders.", "created_at": "2008-05-12T19:00:23Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6b20b48d8833a109208aa54ce6d405e922b3727b", "message": "Patch from Chis Foster that fixes up the scons build system, and gets rid of annoying newline at end of file warnings.", "created_at": "2008-05-12T18:56:49Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "30c3eb07583689d611c708effe8ee151599c2fae", "message": "Actually enable the parser.  I've had this on in my local copy for a while, and just kept forgetting to commit it.", "created_at": "2008-05-12T18:45:45Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9601347e840f4fafe5dcbe2e4511cfff3d263ee9", "message": "Add the reference shaders, for use as testcases.", "created_at": "2008-05-09T13:09:54Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6a928a49c2f814a9d7813058379467e85824c1f3", "message": "Lots of bugfixes.  We can now parse all of the example shaders in the RSL\nspecification.", "created_at": "2008-05-09T13:09:24Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "364f3f680206c44edcaf2482a823dc09479f6b8a", "message": "First attempt at expression parsing.", "created_at": "2008-05-09T11:54:01Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9baf4026374c3fd5c04a568bab528ea0fe494783", "message": "Fix typo.", "created_at": "2008-05-09T11:50:58Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2f6d173cda1f9132e6b606cde00b477a2a9754f6", "message": "Fix typo.", "created_at": "2008-05-09T11:50:25Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3c0a90e1bcd37d203565e9fd1b4020b6642907ce", "message": "Add string constant tokens.", "created_at": "2008-05-09T07:02:30Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e6ca36f078313e375a65eb6211c14220bcb6b4b", "message": "Big improvements to statement parsing.  We now correctly parse:\n\nfloat main() {\n  float a;\n}\n\nNext up: expressions!", "created_at": "2008-03-16T08:17:01Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "db2a119a674887bf11c3ea66b3bfd704e5230d3b", "message": "Fix a few stupid bugs in the lexer.", "created_at": "2008-03-16T08:04:01Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "065654d6a45e7573eddbf1ef1e8b21ccbe278c15", "message": "Fix an error causing an infinite loop in lexing numerics.", "created_at": "2008-03-16T07:52:58Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1ce914cb1420fbb96d4a46f1d2e37dd7623020aa", "message": "Fix a pair of FIXME's.", "created_at": "2008-03-16T05:24:25Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "16646850134a8658638e7e0acaa799bb23cd8586", "message": "Improve the while loop statement.", "created_at": "2008-03-15T23:03:48Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "be3831e88e6679cf0469a2bf8407acee37410fa5", "message": "This file was deleted a while ago.", "created_at": "2008-03-15T23:02:15Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3374721bd117a98a5c461392a11b47b2e0ec36af", "message": "Add support for more statements in the parser.", "created_at": "2008-03-15T23:01:38Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f7d9d0fc1a190ef1b332620fc579914c882845ee", "message": "Add a bit more to the parser, as well as adding tokens for the DOT and CARET\noperators.", "created_at": "2008-02-11T05:23:02Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1b9df7156e5c4059546bee9cb18264b5d3bd013e", "message": "Make the consume() method return the consumed token.", "created_at": "2008-02-11T03:58:03Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3d2a6bd5062bf66718ff8286d17ff5413b5003d8", "message": "Add the skeleton of a parser.", "created_at": "2008-02-11T03:54:17Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4062b1e5a07864a9edfdae0cd4ec275ade39322d", "message": "Didn't mean to add a leftover build product.", "created_at": "2008-02-07T10:26:27Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "13454b4241c48e247a0e3e5f06fe79975f31c89a", "message": "Get rid of some unneeded directory structure.", "created_at": "2008-02-07T10:25:53Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3aebc42a43a55d3842da95fca44788143566bea8", "message": "Cache the spelling of unknown tokens as well.", "created_at": "2008-01-28T07:42:52Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "686123f87a70a4845b40249f264b3850378a5f9e", "message": "Add support for caching the spelling of identifiers and numeric constants in a StringPool.", "created_at": "2008-01-28T07:32:33Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7b781d80f16bf099bbbaf8c39e96b25da4366b30", "message": "Add support for lexing numeric constants.", "created_at": "2008-01-28T07:18:48Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5537ddc2591df246cf271fdecb3801a0449bac67", "message": "Pre-initialize the keyword hashtable with the proper size, since we know how many keywords are in the language.", "created_at": "2008-01-27T10:30:31Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f1fcfe26a200a33c003191b3a24815212fadbd09", "message": "Work around some weirdness of StringMap.  The keyword lexer now passes rudimentary tests!", "created_at": "2008-01-27T10:28:33Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dd53567f67b5370147b5d24355144afe109a4d03", "message": "Make the default build have debug info.", "created_at": "2008-01-27T10:27:47Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "49592ca8e331bb06488eaea45c075fae856f77e9", "message": "Add a rudimentary lexer implementation. This hasn't been tested at all, but in theory\nit should support pretty much everything except numeric constants.  A lot of this\ncode is based on code from clang.", "created_at": "2008-01-27T09:47:27Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "12bea4faab80015b035e1fedd684356c18eb1396", "message": "Add a method to turn character indices into line numbers.", "created_at": "2008-01-27T00:07:59Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "902230e2ad3d3000a73516370379003f82999894", "message": "Add a skeleton of a tool.", "created_at": "2008-01-26T23:49:41Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "74212b46b7b287b73ee49312b179ab7f40de94f5", "message": "Reorganize some stuff.  Since RSL is single-file, we don't need a separate source\nmanager from the lexer.", "created_at": "2008-01-26T22:37:24Z", "repo": "rsl-llvm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha