": "Fix a bounds error that was causing the misrendering of trimmed images.", "created_at": "2009-12-16T20:21:53Z", "repo": "spritepack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8638da8fc8ea35ea381d0feeea3418e1ebc5e811", "message": "ALMOST working autotrim.", "created_at": "2009-12-15T23:02:24Z", "repo": "spritepack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "62ac94b90962bd09fa7c411ad0ade65f53606d1a", "message": "Merge branch 'master' of github.com:resistor/spritepack", "created_at": "2009-12-15T22:44:28Z", "repo": "spritepack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "88a1ada3b3c2dbe8b9db2b9ba71ff35389730595", "message": "Basic support for cropped images.", "created_at": "2009-12-15T22:44:14Z", "repo": "spritepack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "76413af2920cc8688327fcc4d11913e66a6ff21b", "message": "Add a simple image trimmer.", "created_at": "2009-12-15T22:25:07Z", "repo": "spritepack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6c7caf56fe5c492e54b978cd8e4f37fe3a2887dd", "message": "Split img_t into a header file.", "created_at": "2009-12-15T22:14:16Z", "repo": "spritepack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3a9526cf53a6f7710b2e74f3c28803aa55fd8545", "message": "First attempt at using libpng for reading input files.  Not currently working.", "created_at": "2009-12-13T22:18:52Z", "repo": "spritepack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "89f779ed29f7de5059614f2ee3055de695c75ac1", "message": "Add a prototype for encoding with libpng.", "created_at": "2009-12-13T21:58:19Z", "repo": "spritepack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2767238efe1475d7f35d5c0c722e08978b29b760", "message": "Fix a warning.", "created_at": "2009-12-13T21:41:50Z", "repo": "spritepack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "83d9a473604412ea3a9c02ef1b43c169c3198e40", "message": "Start to add support for using libpng for encoding/decoding.", "created_at": "2009-12-13T21:41:18Z", "repo": "spritepack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1b7afdbefbb33fae1a424ffac45182dd7c011a5d", "message": "Implement backedge limiting, and blacklisting.  Trace-extension is now in the same ballpark as the old version, performance-wise, but still lags somewhat.", "created_at": "2010-09-01T08:44:29Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5fa99f1195b372ddecde33abcdee0b272c1fd7cc", "message": "Now with working (but slow) trace extension.", "created_at": "2010-09-01T08:18:44Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3a0b3d037ae01820a9e3bed9f97ae546c82c7f71", "message": "Add a basic implementation of trace extension.", "created_at": "2010-09-01T07:05:36Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "634a1597afc68cb9b857845d531bfb285547e4a8", "message": "Stub out the beginnings of trace extension.  Also, fix a bug where we weren't recording alternate iterations of loops.\nThis is a net performance loss right now (since we're doing more tracing), but it should help in the future.", "created_at": "2010-09-01T06:29:11Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "431dfb73a5c62aed54d1ee8389a27201aa780837", "message": "Don't use names for the JIT'd functions.  This will simplify things when we need to recompile functions.", "created_at": "2010-09-01T05:57:21Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f4bb03812c1e24e4d559af41705dd829205f5788", "message": "Add two new magic variables to the JIT, extension_root and extension_leaf.  The JIT'd code will use these to communicate\nthe nature of the side exit to the trace recorder so that it can begin trace extension.", "created_at": "2010-09-01T05:48:26Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c65a42fd3a1c5c5a1fd9f8df312041c451467d3a", "message": "Fix a bug in code generation of '['.", "created_at": "2010-09-01T05:29:43Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "43218983311ab52c965b32d15ac89fd2e94b8b92", "message": "Micro-optimize record() a bit more.", "created_at": "2010-09-01T04:46:55Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "077ea8700ff9826a53d58ba2cdb36a8190652d17", "message": "Get rid of the executed flag in favor of setting the mode directly from the compiled trace.  This is another marginal performance improvement\n(from getting rid of a branch in record_simple), improving mandelbrot.b to 8.2s. Again, this is another babystep towards proper trace extension/recompilation.", "created_at": "2010-09-01T01:38:14Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1b5668255dc754fc39bdc963461f8b16451001a9", "message": "Use an explicit mode flag to indicate the tracer state.  This is actually a slight performance win (0.5s) on mandelbrot.b,\nprobably because it removes an indirect store from the hot path of BrainFTraceRecorder::record().\n\nIn reality, though, this is just preparatory work for a real trace extension/recompilation system.  The next step will be\nto merge it with the executed flag.", "created_at": "2010-08-31T21:24:02Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d0aec07cd1e87c61ba0e81cac6225b4c5261e19b", "message": "Be more aggressive about detecting hot traces.  Also, introduce a\nsynthetic opcode '0' to represent the common operation of zero'ing out a\nbyte.  We detect this idiom in the preprocessor and lower it to '0',\nwhich leads to much more efficient interpretation and codegen.\n\nThis improves mandelrot marginally to 11s, and bench.bf improves\ndramatically to 0.2s.", "created_at": "2010-08-30T21:23:37Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c660a21ac43d05e92d0d3677361df424a25cb95d", "message": "Add a README.", "created_at": "2010-08-30T07:32:19Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7efb8fee48a68f58ed02282426577984caf2db34", "message": "More comments.", "created_at": "2010-08-30T07:26:03Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e4b8a2ddf0aac1f335f08ad8d23245138d85e8e8", "message": "Fix comment.", "created_at": "2010-08-30T07:22:53Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fc4a35654f69373e01e928ee027ee295bd907014", "message": "Rename BrainFDriver.cpp.", "created_at": "2010-08-30T07:16:10Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f5ac0a77a1f96bc29120aff91c949d1f76671420", "message": "Add a high-level block comment to this file.", "created_at": "2010-08-30T07:10:59Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ac90cf84eeeb607dbff713e8145d555ae613f694", "message": "More comments.", "created_at": "2010-08-30T07:01:42Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "74423bbefb7b854614bf1294073625d98792bb3e", "message": "More cleanup + comments.", "created_at": "2010-08-30T06:44:39Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ff1fe029cf3bdd78e6f4d49c4d5f961bc4bd4bc", "message": "Begin cleaning up and documenting code.", "created_at": "2010-08-30T06:23:48Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8a791b7c4b94add9c700a854cf03a418f4744ebd", "message": "Hoist the pass manager setup code.", "created_at": "2010-08-30T06:10:52Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fc8f3f2be08f132e55e6bf55ee17caad00efbb9f", "message": "Eliminate some dead code, and use aggressive code generation.", "created_at": "2010-08-29T08:57:34Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "75fb2119b376f15cc576f7b54503bcb28dd5679e", "message": "Working code generation for the direct threaded interpreter!  bench.bf is now 0.7s, mandelbrot.b is now 11.9s.", "created_at": "2010-08-29T08:44:49Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "08a7f15d88fb557ecdf1dbc467886cfa476fc3a8", "message": "First attempt at getting the code generator working with the direct threaded interpreter.", "created_at": "2010-08-29T08:27:37Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f9560c948b2d0801376c30c14d1195176c1c6ea9", "message": "Re-enable the tracer, but continue to disable code generation.", "created_at": "2010-08-29T07:10:10Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c44215ff31fae50a99364ac1cdaafc69194bfb33", "message": "Activate the direct-threaded interpreter, and disable the tracer until it is compatible with it.", "created_at": "2010-08-29T06:53:32Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "916099526f971d8d56b52792a981fbac4dc89520", "message": "Add direct threaded opcode implementations.  Not connected to the driver yet.", "created_at": "2010-08-29T06:28:34Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d6015a93ce072c3bff803b23fda874a57af68487", "message": "Preprocess the source file to strip comments, and to compute a static jump map which enables a less stupid implementation of '['.\nThis improves bench.bf to 0.9s and mandbrot.b from 32s to 13s.", "created_at": "2010-08-28T08:32:17Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3594c8481b985d5ea8a5bbea80981504821813ce", "message": "Add a longer-running testcase.", "created_at": "2010-08-28T08:32:05Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d4c7fac1cc50899c43683175ff91e205ed2bcf95", "message": "Use a more aggressive optimization list.  Improves bench.bf to 1.3s.", "created_at": "2010-08-28T07:56:12Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "34957754169961d513068f1686a882e19c5fad3a", "message": "Didn't mean to enable this.", "created_at": "2010-08-28T07:55:54Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8dda8c982cd5f840759348f82c685dc794db0f76", "message": "Improve code-generation of nexted loops.", "created_at": "2010-08-28T07:40:36Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4ba43587127ad5f1a9235865d7d33e94e48c5013", "message": "Fix codegen of squares.bf.", "created_at": "2010-08-27T22:00:51Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cce8473507f7f308ecbe2925e99c2e24af70bbd8", "message": "Fix codegen of I/O opcodes and return the proper array pointer on trace\nexit.", "created_at": "2010-08-27T21:37:10Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d87dff82381338e1a0a62661f9e145116fc9a6a0", "message": "Revert \"Revert \"Lower the tracing and compilation thresholds.  Imrpoves bench.bf from\"\"\n\nThis reverts commit d5477abac58e447162c310ac696d621fc1c5c9fa.", "created_at": "2010-08-27T21:20:01Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d5477abac58e447162c310ac696d621fc1c5c9fa", "message": "Revert \"Lower the tracing and compilation thresholds.  Imrpoves bench.bf from\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6da49741e8092ec0a1a1f29432749ceca60c362f.", "created_at": "2010-08-27T21:19:46Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6da49741e8092ec0a1a1f29432749ceca60c362f", "message": "Lower the tracing and compilation thresholds.  Imrpoves bench.bf from\n5.3s to 1.9s.", "created_at": "2010-08-27T17:48:20Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e2f3877545c46363c0d55552db2e1ac32d2417cd", "message": "Specialize the recording method and rearrange the interpreter loop to\nmake the tracing engine much faster.  Improves bench.bf from 7.9s to\n5.3s.", "created_at": "2010-08-27T17:31:02Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "19a93ed26424889346cffc65b3d012c863f0e26b", "message": "Initial import of a tracing brainfuck JIT.", "created_at": "2010-08-27T16:50:21Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b607125083e352242ce4f59aac3ffcbf324f85fa", "message": "Add basic tracing infrastructure, complete with dual-versioning of the interpreter bytecode.\nThis imposes a 2x slowdown (to 12.3s) for mandelbrot.b, but that should be the high water mark\nin terms of performance.  It should only get better from here.", "created_at": "2010-09-17T05:59:57Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "40557888978e7f68d098d88fa05d235e79ebb5ea", "message": "In a moment of \"Why the **** didn't I do this before!?\", switch to a computed-goto based\ndirect threading implementation.  This more than halves the time to run mandelbrot.b,\nfrom 14.2s to 6.9s.  This interpreter is now faster than the original trace-based JIT ever was. :-/", "created_at": "2010-09-09T04:33:51Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d81a9de381443d9056d02dd40d0ca6a5257bbb06", "message": "Shave off another 1.5s from mandelbrot.b by pattern matching destructive cell-to-cell adds.", "created_at": "2010-09-07T07:08:24Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e0fed39abdd91e83c8c461fcc05bb3adeefc9d75", "message": "Shave approximately two seconds off mandelbrot.b by implementing op_back more intelligently.", "created_at": "2010-09-07T07:07:01Z", "repo": "BrainFTracing2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}